{"id":"wb-5-97","name":"笔架山潮州窑遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"笔架山潮州窑遗址","text":"笔架山潮州窑遗址位于广东省潮州市湘桥区桥东街道东兴居委会笔架山山麓，是宋朝潮州窑窑灶遗址。\n历史上潮州窑的主要产区多有变动，此处遗址为宋朝时潮州窑的主要产区，元代已停烧。遗址包括十一座窑灶遗址，并出土大量瓷器，视为研究北宋潮州窑的至关重要的实物依据。2001年6月，中国国务院公布为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%AC%94%E6%9E%B6%E5%B1%B1%E6%BD%AE%E5%B7%9E%E7%AA%91%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":94091434,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94091434","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/1ec66796462b68a1dedee42c.jpg","title":"20230207_Site_of_Chaozhou_Ware_at_Bijia_Mountain.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20230207_Site_of_Chaozhou_Ware_at_Bijia_Mountain.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a9/20230207_Site_of_Chaozhou_Ware_at_Bijia_Mountain.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Site of Chaozhou Ware at Bijia Mountain","width":320,"height":213}}